# The PIR noise poller (thehimmat/pir-sound-tracker, apps/poller/selfhost/), which runs on this VM as
# its own Compose project and shares only the pir-edge network with this gateway. It serves /ping,
# /health and the live-readings WebSocket at /ws (Caddy upgrades WebSockets without extra config).
# Without that stack running, this name answers 502 and nothing else is affected.
#
# Let's Encrypt on the sslip.io name, not through Cloudflare: the poller isn't an atthebunga.com
# site, and the web app on Vercel only needs a stable wss:// address.
pir.{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	reverse_proxy pir-poller:8080
}
